1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,367
This is Episode 37.

3
00:00:07,367 --> 00:00:09,734
Maya draws a sun.

4
00:00:09,734 --> 00:00:12,593
She wants everyone to see it.

5
00:00:12,593 --> 00:00:14,960
She runs to Sammy.

6
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,914
Then to Eddie.

7
00:00:16,914 --> 00:00:18,989
Then to Lulu.

8
00:00:18,989 --> 00:00:20,585
Oh no!

9
00:00:20,585 --> 00:00:24,401
She changes her mind and draws a star.

10
00:00:24,401 --> 00:00:27,925
Now she has to run all over again.

11
00:00:27,925 --> 00:00:30,651
Here comes the drawing board.

12
00:00:30,651 --> 00:00:34,401
Every friend gets a little board of their own.

13
00:00:34,401 --> 00:00:37,632
Maya draws a heart on the big one.

14
00:00:37,632 --> 00:00:39,002
Pop!

15
00:00:39,002 --> 00:00:42,579
The same heart shows up on all three.

16
00:00:42,579 --> 00:00:44,933
She draws a star.

17
00:00:44,933 --> 00:00:48,125
Every board changes at once.

18
00:00:48,125 --> 00:00:50,239
Nobody runs.

19
00:00:50,239 --> 00:00:54,215
Draw it once, everyone sees it right now.

20
00:00:54,215 --> 00:00:56,848
That is the drawing board.

21
00:00:56,848 --> 00:00:59,428
Now you know AppSync!

22
00:00:59,428 --> 00:01:04,122
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

